0..79 Comment "// A record type\'s faces: each a set of the record\'s labels, named in a `where`"
80..104 Comment "// block after the type."
105..107 Comment "//"
108..184 Comment "// A record type\'s labels are its boundary. A face over them names a part of"
185..247 Comment "// the record, so a later form restricts a value to that part."
248..250 Comment "//"
251..328 Comment "// The block names each face as a theory\'s `face` member does. The block ends"
329..408 Comment "// the type member at its `}`, as a `data` block ends its declaration. A record"
409..477 Comment "// type with no block keeps its labels as its boundary all the same."
478..480 Comment "//"
481..561 Comment "// - see: `pathological/desc/record-faces.gandr` — a face past the labels, and"
562..594 Comment "//   a face named twice, refused"
595..674 Comment "// - see: `model/desc/shaped-signature.gandr` — a theory\'s `boundary` and its"
675..685 Comment "//   faces"
686..753 Comment "// - see: #4454 — not implemented: the extension type over a face"
